  "prefLabel": "Ins 3203.07 Inducements or Rebating",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3203.07 Inducements or Rebating. A financial institution shall not offer special benefits, such as rebates or discounts on insurance in violation of RSA 417:4, IX(a), RSA 402:39, or RSA 402:40 or any other provisions of law.\n\nSource. #7064, eff 7-24-99",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins3200.html"
